{"paragraphs":[{"text":"%md\n# Illustrative CQL queries\n### Ref. '2.4 Cassandra Database Design og Bruk' in report.\n___\n**Note**  \nThis notebook is part of a collections which has to be run in the following order to work as intended:\n1. [1_TLC_CQL_DB_Build.zpln](https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/TLC)\n2. [2_TLC_Frame_to_Table](https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/TLC)\n3. [3_TLC_Cassandra_Queries](https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/TLC)\n___\n\nThis notebook consist of queries related to the TLC data which has been created in the notebooks [TLC_CQL_DB_Build.zpln](https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/TLC) and [TLC_CQL_DB_Build.zpln](https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/TLC). Both these notebooks need to be run for this notebook to function properly.\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-07T01:50:09+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":true,"language":"markdown","completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762478970230_1018635191","id":"paragraph_1762478970230_1018635191","dateCreated":"2025-11-07T01:29:30+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true,"dateFinished":"2025-11-07T01:50:09+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-07T01:50:09+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h1>Illustrative CQL queries</h1>\n<h3>Ref. &lsquo;2.4 Cassandra Database Design og Bruk&rsquo; in report.</h3>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Note</strong><br />\nThis notebook is part of a collections which has to be run in the following order to work as intended:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a